<b:skin><![CDATA[
/* nbadfs.com shell: the real design loads from GitHub (site/app.css, site/body.html, site/app.js). */
body{margin:0;background:#ffffff;color:#15171c;font:16px/1.5 'Source Sans 3', -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif}
